    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/9f54ed2215a94e48a4b020243de6655f.poster.avif?t=1740390503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/9f54ed2215a94e48a4b020243de6655f.webm?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/9f54ed2215a94e48a4b020243de6655f.mp4?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Degenheim</strong> is an action-packed isometric rogue-lite hack &amp; slasher, set in a world gone absolutely mad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/0bb9b3220a0ec8889258636c2d29b615.avif?t=1740390503\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash your way through hordes of degenerate enemies in a world where nothing is off limits and become the hero we did not deserve, but so desperately needed. Choose your path and playstyle, upgrade your talents, equip yourself with weird items and even weirder effects, then slap some upgrades on those as well until your power levels are over 9000. Go HAM and wreak absolute havoc between your adversaries. Retribution is served!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/ae53686d177d6bd9d8fb3b133dfee1b7.poster.avif?t=1740390503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/ae53686d177d6bd9d8fb3b133dfee1b7.webm?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/ae53686d177d6bd9d8fb3b133dfee1b7.mp4?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different and unique. The unstable world of Degenheim always gives you different environments, different enemies, different encounters, different abilities and different circumstances. Tap into the world with seemingly endless possibilities, combinations, and some seriously questionable choices. The name of the game is endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/0c32d2980f9417f25aba7396790d092a.poster.avif?t=1740390503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/0c32d2980f9417f25aba7396790d092a.webm?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/0c32d2980f9417f25aba7396790d092a.mp4?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/7c6b4553b66eaf5b3a6ac3643e0b8393.avif?t=1740390503\" /></span>Never fear failure! Each death or failed encounter will ultimately help you to advance further, piece by piece. With each run you get better, stronger, and more beefed up - whether you succeed or not. Gather valuable resources which you can spend for persistent upgrades in your homebase, allowing you to venture beyond what you have seen thus far and see how the game world unfolds. Now go get juiced up and whoop some degenerate butts out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/5646768b6de0232e0c636e1d1fcf774b.poster.avif?t=1740390503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/5646768b6de0232e0c636e1d1fcf774b.webm?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/5646768b6de0232e0c636e1d1fcf774b.mp4?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/a07462df5be41c320c79066c8f6a2758.avif?t=1740390503\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/df09d98b45a444548eabe91d1f31f917.poster.avif?t=1740390503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/df09d98b45a444548eabe91d1f31f917.webm?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/df09d98b45a444548eabe91d1f31f917.mp4?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/9f54ed2215a94e48a4b020243de6655f.poster.avif?t=1740390503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/9f54ed2215a94e48a4b020243de6655f.webm?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/9f54ed2215a94e48a4b020243de6655f.mp4?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Degenheim</strong> is an action-packed isometric rogue-lite hack &amp; slasher, set in a world gone absolutely mad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/0bb9b3220a0ec8889258636c2d29b615.avif?t=1740390503\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash your way through hordes of degenerate enemies in a world where nothing is off limits and become the hero we did not deserve, but so desperately needed. Choose your path and playstyle, upgrade your talents, equip yourself with weird items and even weirder effects, then slap some upgrades on those as well until your power levels are over 9000. Go HAM and wreak absolute havoc between your adversaries. Retribution is served!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/ae53686d177d6bd9d8fb3b133dfee1b7.poster.avif?t=1740390503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439960/extras/ae53686d177d6bd9d8fb3b133dfee1b7.webm?t=1740390503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9